## 🔄 HTTP Request and Response

A basic web communication process looks like this:

```text
Browser
   ↓
HTTP Request
   ↓
Web Server
   ↓
HTTP Response
   ↓
Browser
```

The browser sends a request to the server, and the server sends back a response.

## 📨 Common HTTP Methods

| Method | Purpose          |
| ------ | ---------------- |
| GET    | Retrieve data    |
| POST   | Send/create data |
| PUT    | Update data      |
| DELETE | Delete data      |

